@baseUrl = https://localhost:7155
@customerToken = paste-customer-jwt-here
@bookingId = 1
@transactionUuid = paste-transaction-uuid-here
@callbackData = paste-base64-eSewa-callback-here

### Initiate eSewa UAT payment for a customer's pending booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payment/initiate/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### eSewa redirects to this callback after payment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payment/success?data={{callbackData}}

### eSewa redirects here if payment fails or is canceled
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payment/failure?transaction_uuid={{transactionUuid}}

### Recheck a pending payment after a delayed or missing redirect
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payment/status/{{transactionUuid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
